        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Isiboseti mwana wa-Saulo naakamvwa kuti Abineri wafwa muHebroni, maanza aakwe akali kukompama, abalo ba-Israyeli boonse bakazingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
